le part-time employment with excellent career opportunities.&nbsp;<span style="font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">Typical roles include a Lead Fitness Instructor, Personal Trainers and Group Fitness Instructors.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p>Due to our partnership, any Study Active Graduate is guaranteed an interview and park visit with BMF. In addition to this Study Active works closely with BMF to ensure that our courses reflect the values and mission of what BMF is all about.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;For further information please visit the <a href="https://www.bemilitaryfit.com/jobs" class="" target="_blank"><u>BMF website</u></a> where you will find the latest opportunities and further information on the BMF / Study Active partnership.<br></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div class="gf_row gf_row-gap-15" id="r-1526982534839" data-label="Row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1526982534839" data-row-gap="15px" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_col-md-12 gf_column" id="c-1526961836711" style="min-height: auto;" data-id="1526961836711"><div class="element-wrap" id="e-1526982534865" data-label="Separator" data-icon="gpicon-separator" data-id="1526982534865"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc="" data-align="left"><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div class="element-wrap" id="e-1529524867098" data-label="Heading" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-id="1529524867098"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-sm" data-exc=""><h3>Our Top Courses all come with a secured BMF Interview&nbsp;</h3></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div class="gf_row" id="r-1529406456171" data-label="Row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1529406456171" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-md-4" id="c-1529358512920" style="min-height: auto;" data-id="152935851